  <item>
    <title>Weekend 09: Cecii | 再见上海大都会，走向汉普郡乡村的本真生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6677a792b6a8412729a74d45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6677a792b6a8412729a74d45</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 04:41:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Carnet weekend将在周末轻松更新，与不同专业领域人士闲聊一刻，为你发掘他们热情背后的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Cecii @英国克里希那穆提基金会教育中心一员</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> cecii的现状，离开大都市去乡村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a> 都市带来的摧残，身体到心灵的改变，从练瑜伽和改变饮食开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a> 对英国的感受，更加以人为本的社会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 文化属性与留下深刻印象的英国人：松弛感vs自我规训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 人与环境的关系，环境投射思维模式：总要追求更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> ai替代工作环节后的有闲生活怎么过？什么都不做的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2045">34:05</a> 思考作为一种工具的局限性，一个前INTJ的体会：情绪与感受是两件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 情绪是感受的一种标签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 人为什么爱表达？了解自己，然后呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> 亲密关系是认识自己和对方的过程，新晋人妻心得分享：爱是包容与成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2749">45:49</a> 打破心之墙壁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">48:14</a> 墙壁打破之后，不回到原来，才是本来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3087">51:27</a> 失去自我vs扩展自我的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3258">54:18</a> 在关系中先看到的是什么？共情与边界感的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3526">58:46</a> 婚后感想：不任性、更平和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3784">1:03:04</a> 本真生活与都市化社会的关系：保持距离，保持与人的链接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4174">1:09:34</a> 未来的学术之路：人需要创造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4311">1:11:51</a> 生活本身真的需要很多钱吗？学习中心一年的预算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4417">1:13:37</a> 人不是衡量自我价值的工具：总在寻求比较与认可，人不是“人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">1:17:30</a> 爱是什么？是永远没有答案，一直在认识之中</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期提及的一些相关概念与书籍：</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Isha瑜伽</span></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26596098/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26596098/"><span>克里希那穆提《富有创造力的心灵》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1005193/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1005193/"><span>克里希那穆提《重新认识你自己》</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp865RVnd9Ryrvlb6hbkz7Wew3fg.m4a" length="86002297" type="audio/mp4"/>
