  <item>
    <title>Weekend 07: Bridget | 一个INTJ是如何温和地创造内衣品牌The Blender和自己的世界的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f6cd3f6764957079d2b4c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f6cd3f6764957079d2b4c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Mar 2024 11:00:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Carnet Weekend将在周末轻松更新，与不同专业领域人士闲聊一刻，为你发掘他们热情背后的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Bridget @The Blender，内衣品牌主理人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 用很多个提问开始了解高颜值的她</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 设计是一种很理性的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> Bridget的MBTI，与为何选择创业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a> 为什么选择贴身衣物作为创业的赛道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 创业合伙二三事，如何与合伙人磨合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 品牌发展至今在产品和创意层面有何精进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 内部沟通的方式和技巧，管理精髓：极度求真、极度透明、创意择优</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> 回望品牌成长之路：产品为先，TA并不能被计划，联名……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a> 运气与玄学，Bridget的个人爱好和对玄学的观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 一个温和的人如何坚持稳定的自我，面对变化的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 如何面对痛苦和低谷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 入世，又何妨？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 对未来的规划和期待，The Blender的愿景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a> 怎样做一个work-life balanced的创业人？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZQtAPmcOrgTU4-0CbRcLF4rYCj.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1UpZeD3MiqLQXbeM2NSzT2LoW0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期节目涉及品牌的创立、主理人的心理成长之路等丰富话题，欢迎搜索：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 品牌：The Blender（天猫、抖音、小红书、微信等各平台）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 书籍：《原则》《人生十二法则》 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
