  <item>
    <title>Weekend 06: Luis | 假做真时真亦假，真做假时呢？一个青年导演的大言大语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65879b83b8fd2bc060f60890</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65879b83b8fd2bc060f60890</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Dec 2023 02:46:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Carnet Weekend将在周末轻松更新，与不同专业领域人士闲聊一刻，为你发掘他们热情背后的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Luis@青年导演</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 经典介绍自己环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 做影像输出是经验还是天赋？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 在这过程中最享受的是什么——人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 一次创作的开展方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> 如何分辨值得信赖的人？真诚是唯一标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 为什么关注、如何辨别真诚的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 真诚在现实中的副作用与应对方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 真诚如何与我有关？表达还是聆听？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 聊聊共情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> Luis喜欢的导演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 也是纯爱战士、海贼王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">32:36</a> 明年的创作计划 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 《人间》篇章如何表达？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a> 《与神对话》延展出的讨论：创造vs发现，怕vs爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2981">49:41</a> 什么是自己人生的底色？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（彩蛋必听太好笑了很荒谬）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3076">51:16</a> Luis许愿倪妮、周冬雨聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目提到不少导演和作品，如果感兴趣欢迎自行搜索关注。如果你对Luis感兴趣，欢迎关注她的IG@luisssss_ 或给我们留言！</span></p>]]></description>
