  <item>
    <title>Weekend 05: Congya | 用共情和洞察力讲好长期故事的时尚公关人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657ab0b6991e2ee608cec9fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657ab0b6991e2ee608cec9fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Dec 2023 07:37:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Carnet Weekend将在周末轻松更新，与不同专业领域人士的闲聊一刻，为你发掘他们热情背后的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Congya@CyPRESS</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> Congya是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 对人感兴趣是开启公关之路的初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 做公关的不同阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 公关这个职业遭受的误解和对此真正的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 过往经历中遇到过最大的挑战：公关是讲长期故事的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 用共情力和换位思考解决难题 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> i人做公关！和团队的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 公关行业近年来的变化：入门简单资深难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 最想坚持的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 真正的生活状态是什么样的？如何分配自己的时间？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a> 将打德州作为一种兴趣 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 对公关行业未来的看法和自己的展望 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对时尚公关行业和Congya有兴趣，欢迎搜索关注她的公关顾问机构@CyPRESS（公众号）@CyPRESScommunications（🍠）和她个人的小红书、微博、IG等平台@Congya。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljkbsRVdJ5cSATv0kKYiWDH1Btqa.m4a" length="39200360" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zodm1yUkZwNk4xLXhZc3ZnSnBCcGpJdi1JT1UucG5n.png"/>
