  <item>
    <title>VOL.8: 什么是以循环性与可持续作为目标的创意？｜Yidi Chen</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d8b06c80c9ec4c5f22a0c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d8b06c80c9ec4c5f22a0c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Aug 2023 10:28:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Carnet手册03</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Sustainability in Carnet</span></p><span></span><p><span>当越来越多的人关注“可持续”，我们与三位在这个领域的她们对话，从商业、创意和机构的角度，解读这个热门词的多面相。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Yidi Chen</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 介绍自己有点难？从创意的角度关注可持续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> 令人印象深刻的”可持续“实践，源于系统性思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 可持续vs环保，二者的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 为什么选择这个专业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 中文语境里的sustainability，一个意识问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 什么是S.O.S(System of Survival)？从创意和解决问题出发关注可持续性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> S.O.S的目标与规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 大的企业怎么做？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 可持续是一种思维方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 巴厘岛之行，不一样的可持续业态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3046">50:46</a> 佛山之行，假发探秘，新能源汽车与电池……国内的可持续业态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> 从线性到闭环循环，结构性变革的必要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4017">1:06:57</a> 爱宠人的可持续，一切回归产品</span></p><span></span><p><span>隐藏彩蛋：萌宠时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在小红书和Instragram搜索Yidi和她的System of Survival (S.O.S)，持续关注她的创意输出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠: @Yidi_CHEN @SystemofSurvival</span></p><span></span><p><span>IG: @systemofsurvial_official</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎关注Carnet Talk，每辑为你带来同一个话题里每个人的不同视角。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
