    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d876cf3fa4090b7419ec4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Aug 2023 06:23:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Carnet手册03</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Sustainability in Carnet</span></p><span></span><p><span>当越来越多的人关注“可持续”，我们与三位在这个领域的她们对话，从商业、创意和机构的角度，解读这个热门词的多面相。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Karen Du</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> &nbsp;特别说明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> &nbsp;什么是impact HUB shanghai与R.I.S.E？在可持续领域在做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> &nbsp;对可持续的传播方式：自上而下vs自下而上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> &nbsp;打造一个类大众点评的“可持续标准”，R.I.S.E小程序“RERISE”的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> &nbsp;国内外与消费者沟通的差异性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> &nbsp;内容之外更创新的解题思路，欢迎更多玩家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a> &nbsp;回收的学问，如何帮助各个环节与时尚行业进行对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">48:57</a> &nbsp;气候正义背后的蝴蝶效应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> &nbsp;如何一句话向奶奶说明自己的工作？可持续这个词与消费者和生活的距离感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3413">56:53</a> &nbsp;从教育开始：爱时尚的年轻人何去何从？更年轻的群体在关注什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3696">1:01:36</a> &nbsp;实际话语权：消费者反馈影响每个环节的商业决策，坚持推行一套理解标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4010">1:06:50</a> &nbsp;数据驱动，持续改善R.I.S.E小程序 - “RERISE” - 打造可持续时尚消费决策引导平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4244">1:10:44</a> &nbsp;创业心得分享：先开始，重视感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>听到最后彩蛋 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4688">1:18:08</a> ：发展热爱同一份事业的员工成为投资人</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索关注Karen创立的R.I.S.E可持续消费创新平台，RERISE小程序，与Impact Hub Shanghai及更多城市。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fusk8LK6E-Mdyr15QpfDUdl9cGs_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎关注Carnet Talk，每辑为你带来同一个话题里每个人的不同视角。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
