    <title>VOL.5: 2023癸卯兔年，道法自然，你准备好了吗？| 常常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63a52a0ce7ab859986035621</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63a52a0ce7ab859986035621</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Dec 2022 04:09:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Carnet手册 02</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Culture in Carnet，量子纠缠，科学的尽头是玄学？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年诺贝尔物理奖授予了三位从事量子纠缠实验的物理学家，这让相信玄学的Carnet有了兴趣，因为玄学的很多理论都与量子力学有着千丝万缕的联系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从玄学的角度去看待人事物，你会发现这个世界真的太有趣了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 口口和常常一起经历的奇妙事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 变美秘籍——狐仙娘娘不可不拜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a> 常常，常大师，专职命理师、法师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">10:07</a> 皈依、传度、受禄的区别，传度“有编制”，受禄“有官职”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 接触道家的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> 道家文化与个人的认知与价值观一脉相承，自然投契</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> 道家带给常常的：共度人生至暗时刻，一切都是必然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> 如何理解命定？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 每个人都有神性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 道是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 善恶的辩证关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> 7年来修行如何精进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> 2023年有什么需要关注的？不破不立，要坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对道家文化感兴趣，不妨将这一期天方夜谭分享给你身边的人。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎关注Carnet Talk，每辑为你带来同一个话题里每个人的不同视角。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
